 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Priya wanted a spring trip to the Smokies.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.486
  },
  {
   "text": "Three nights later, she had twenty browser tabs open and still no plan.",
   "start": 2.936,
   "end": 7.214
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. Start with one plan.",
   "start": 7.814,
   "end": 10.012
  },
  {
   "text": "Our Smokies Trip Pack has three, five and seven-day itineraries,",
   "start": 10.412,
   "end": 14.42
  },
  {
   "text": "the seasons and road openings, where to stay,",
   "start": 14.67,
   "end": 17.054
  },
  {
   "text": "and ten day hikes as G P X files for your phone, numbered to match the plan.",
   "start": 17.304,
   "end": 22.093
  },
  {
   "text": "Priya picked her first trail in ten minutes.",
   "start": 22.693,
   "end": 24.815
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before you plan your trip.",
   "start": 25.415,
   "end": 27.232
  }
